Stack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L50","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listeners.public.ts:50"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The field associated with the listener event, when available."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For a field listener, this is the field that owns the listener even when\nthe event came from one of its "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"watchFields"},{"type":"text","value":". It is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" for\nform-level "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'mount'"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'reset'"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'submit'"},{"type":"text","value":" events."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"value"}]},{"type":"code","value":"value: TValue;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L52","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listeners.public.ts:52"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The value in the listener's scope when the event occurred."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"formapi","text":"formApi","level":3},{"id":"triggerfieldapi","text":"triggerFieldApi?","level":3},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L40)\n\nContext used to conditionally enable or debounce a listener.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### formApi\n\n```ts\nformApi: FormApi<TFormData, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:42](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L42)\n\nThe form associated with the listener event.\n\n***\n\n### triggerFieldApi?\n\n```ts\noptional triggerFieldApi?: AnyFieldApi;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:50](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L50)\n\nThe field associated with the listener event, when available.\n\nFor a field listener, this is the field that owns the listener even when\nthe event came from one of its `watchFields`. It is `undefined` for\nform-level `'mount'`, `'reset'`, and `'submit'` events.\n\n***\n\n### value\n\n```ts\nvalue: TValue;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:52](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L52)\n\nThe value in the listener's scope when the event occurred.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ListenerPredicateContext\ntitle: ListenerPredicateContext\n---\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L40)\n\nContext used to conditionally enable or debounce a listener.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### formApi\n\n```ts\nformApi: FormApi<TFormData, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:42](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L42)\n\nThe form associated with the listener event.\n\n***\n\n### triggerFieldApi?\n\n```ts\noptional triggerFieldApi?: AnyFieldApi;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:50](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L50)\n\nThe field associated with the listener event, when available.\n\nFor a field listener, this is the field that owns the listener even when\nthe event came from one of its `watchFields`. It is `undefined` for\nform-level `'mount'`, `'reset'`, and `'submit'` events.\n\n***\n\n### value\n\n```ts\nvalue: TValue;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:52](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L52)\n\nThe value in the listener's scope when the event occurred.\n"}
